---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Who I work with | Life Story Wealth Planning';
const description = 'A small number of individuals, usually approaching or in retirement, already wealthy, and interested in active risk management. Here is how to tell whether the firm is a fit.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/who-i-work-with">
  <main class="who-page">
    <section class="who-hero">
      <p class="who-eyebrow">Chapter · Who I work with</p>
      <h1 class="who-h1">Who I <em>work with</em></h1>
      <p class="who-lede">A specific portrait of the reader this firm was built for. If you recognise yourself, we should probably talk. If you don't, that is useful too.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="who-portrait app-reveal" aria-labelledby="portrait-h">
      <p class="who-portrait-eyebrow">The portrait</p>
      <p id="portrait-h" class="who-portrait-body">
        Most of my clients spent thirty or forty years earning what they now want to protect. They
        are business owners, former executives, and professionals who reached the point where the
        game changed. The goal is no longer to build more, it is to not lose what is already
        there. Most were introduced to me by someone they trust. Most are approaching retirement
        or already in it. <em>None of them are trying to get rich.</em>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="who-lists">
      <article class="who-list who-list-fit app-reveal" aria-labelledby="fit-h">
        <p class="who-list-eyebrow">
          <span class="who-list-mark" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M2 7 L6 11 L12 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          What we usually have in common
        </p>
        <h2 id="fit-h" class="who-list-h">You've probably arrived at the right page if…</h2>
        <ol class="who-items">
          <li>
            <span class="who-item-num">01</span>
            <p>You've built your wealth. You want to keep what you've built and make sure it keeps serving you.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="who-item-num">02</span>
            <p>You want a portfolio that responds to markets, not one left to their whims.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="who-item-num">03</span>
            <p>You want to work directly with the person managing your money, not through layers of a large firm.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="who-item-num">04</span>
            <p>You read carefully. You ask real questions. You take your time.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </article>

      <article class="who-list who-list-miss app-reveal" aria-labelledby="miss-h">
        <p class="who-list-eyebrow">
          <span class="who-list-mark" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><line x1="3" y1="7" x2="11" y2="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          When I'm probably not the right fit
        </p>
        <h2 id="miss-h" class="who-list-h">You might be better served elsewhere if…</h2>
        <ol class="who-items who-items-quiet">
          <li>
            <span class="who-item-num">01</span>
            <p>You want a passive index portfolio, matched to a benchmark and left alone.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="who-item-num">02</span>
            <p>You want to direct the trades in your account yourself.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="who-item-num">03</span>
            <p>You want product recommendations paid for by commission.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="who-close app-reveal">
      <p class="who-close-body">
        If any of the right-hand list describes you better, there are firms that fit that better
        than I do, and I will say so directly. If the left-hand list is you, the next step is a
        short call.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="who-cta">
      <a class="cta cta-large" href="/contact">Start a conversation</a>
      <a class="cta-ghost cta-ghost-ink" href="/about">Read about Alex first</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .who-page {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 6rem) clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem) clamp(4rem, 6vw, 8rem);
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    display: grid;
    row-gap: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem);
  }
  .who-page > * { max-width: 780px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; width: 100%; }

  /* Hero */
  .who-hero { text-align: center; padding-bottom: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.16); }
  .who-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3 Variable', 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .who-h1 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 60;
  }
  .who-h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--rubric, #8a3324); font-weight: 400; }
  .who-lede {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.4vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.72);
    max-width: 54ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Portrait — the opening paragraph as a manifesto block */
  .who-portrait {
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem) clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem) clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    background: var(--paper-2, #f4ecdc);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(10px);
    transition: opacity 800ms ease, transform 800ms ease;
  }
  .who-portrait.is-in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .who-portrait-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3 Variable', 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .who-portrait-body {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.8vw, 1.42rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    margin: 0;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96, 'SOFT' 40;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .who-portrait-body em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Lists side by side on wide, stacked on narrow */
  .who-lists {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    max-width: 1000px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 820px) {
    .who-lists { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); }
  }

  .who-list {
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    background: transparent;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(138, 51, 36, 0.35);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(10px);
    transition: opacity 800ms ease, transform 800ms ease;
  }
  .who-list.is-in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .who-list-fit {
    background: rgba(201, 161, 90, 0.06);
    border-top-color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    border-top-width: 2px;
  }
  .who-list-miss {
    background: transparent;
    border-top-color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.25);
  }
  .who-list-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3 Variable', 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .who-list-fit .who-list-eyebrow { color: var(--rubric, #8a3324); }
  .who-list-miss .who-list-eyebrow { color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.55); }
  .who-list-mark {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
  }
  .who-list-h {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 1.9vw, 1.5rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96, 'SOFT' 40;
  }
  .who-list-miss .who-list-h { color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.7); }

  .who-items {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.15rem;
  }
  .who-items li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.4rem 1fr;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .who-item-num {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;
  }
  .who-items-quiet .who-item-num { color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.45); }
  .who-items li p {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.88);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .who-items-quiet li p { color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.65); }

  /* Close statement */
  .who-close {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(10px);
    transition: opacity 800ms ease, transform 800ms ease;
  }
  .who-close.is-in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .who-close-body {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.7vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.75);
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96;
  }

  .who-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .who-cta { flex-direction: row; justify-content: center; gap: 1.5rem; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .who-portrait, .who-list, .who-close {
      opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
